{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:02 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:02 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:02 2026-10-29 HKT</p><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)影片截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bc95c48d195576231e5d000757e955e/2026-10/FotoJet_26.jpg\"/><p>今日（29日）下午1時32分，粉嶺公路往上水方向近康樂園發生交通意外，涉及貨車和垃圾車等。其中貨車司機及乘客一度被困，救援人員到場救援，傷者由救護車送往北區醫院治理。現場所見，貨車車頭撼向垃圾車車尾，擋風玻璃爆裂，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:16.174409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:45.536120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:37.236253+00:00","content_hash":"6edaf15d9e7bc89051cebf986adf6ae1ad569afeef7f275a28f7a72ef0849af1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}